{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>But the Levites were not counted, etc., as, etc.</b> Meaning: even though this number is a number of glory and exaltation, for they arranged themselves in the order of the angels who descended with the Shekhinah at Mount Sinai, as our Sages of blessed memory said (Numbers Rabbah 2:3) — nevertheless <b>not</b>, etc. — for the reason that it is the commandment of HaShem: ״לֹא תִפְקֹד וְלֹא תִשָּׂא״ (you shall not count them, nor take their number)."], :book :numbers, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T20:05:53.809439493Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}